{"id":"938378420d182ce3","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-positive-closure.md","title":"T正公式的句法闭包","display":"prop-positive-closure — T正公式的句法闭包","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-positive-closure","aliases":["91-prop-positive-closure"],"display":"prop-positive-closure — T正公式的句法闭包","depends_on":["[[91-df-positive-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-positive-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-positive-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-positive-closure — T正公式的句法闭包"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e4ff0dbf2ccbb847\" href=\"?note=e4ff0dbf2ccbb847\" title=\"91-df-positive-formula\">91-df-positive-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"prop-positive-closure-—-T-正公式的句法闭包\">prop-positive-closure — T 正公式的句法闭包</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\\)</span>\n(<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 只正出现的公式集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e4ff0dbf2ccbb847\" href=\"?note=e4ff0dbf2ccbb847\" title=\"91-df-positive-formula\">91-df-positive-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\\subseteq\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\subseteq\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> (不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的基础语言)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}positive\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{c}\n\\varphi\\land\\psi,\\ \\varphi\\lor\\psi\n\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\\\\\n\\land\\\n\\forall x\\,\\varphi,\\ \\exists x\\,\\varphi\n\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\n\\end{array}\n\\right],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}positive\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{c}\n\\varphi\\land\\psi,\\ \\varphi\\lor\\psi\n\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\\\\\n\\land\\\n\\forall x\\,\\varphi,\\ \\exists x\\,\\varphi\n\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\n\\end{array}\n\\right],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\to\n\\bigl(\n\\theta\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\n\\land\n\\neg\\theta\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\to\n\\bigl(\n\\theta\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\n\\land\n\\neg\\theta\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>合取、析取和量词不改变已有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 出现的极性；对完全不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的公式，\n否定后仍没有负出现的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>。一般的否定会翻转极性，所以\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\\)</span> 并不推出\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\">\\(\\neg\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>这些是句法闭包事实。它们支持单调性证明，但本身不推出真值确定性、\n全 T-schema 或某种归纳模式的可靠性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"prop-positive-closure-—-T-正公式的句法闭包","text":"prop-positive-closure — T 正公式的句法闭包","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-positive-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e4ff0dbf2ccbb847","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-positive-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-positive-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e4ff0dbf2ccbb847","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)$\n($T$ 只正出现的公式集, see [[91-df-positive-formula]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0\\subseteq\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}positive\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{c}\n\\varphi\\land\\psi,\\ \\varphi\\lor\\psi\n\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\\\\\n\\land\\\n\\forall x\\,\\varphi,\\ \\exists x\\,\\varphi\n\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\n\\end{array}\n\\right],","display":true},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\to\n\\bigl(\n\\theta\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\n\\land\n\\neg\\theta\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)","display":false}],"bytes":1443,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["e4ff0dbf2ccbb847"]}